# Prow-style OWNERS file, read by fullsend's `owners_file` authorization
# provider (enabled in .fullsend/config.yaml). This is NOT GitHub's
# .github/CODEOWNERS — that file only routes review requests and is never
# used for authorization.
#
# `approvers` get write-equivalent access for agent slash commands
# (/fs-diagnose, /fs-fix, custom agents). `reviewers` get triage-equivalent
# access (/fs-triage, /fs-review). This grants no actual GitHub repository
# permissions. Users not listed fall back to their normal GitHub roles.
# https://github.com/fullsend-ai/fullsend/blob/main/docs/guides/user/owners-file-authorization.md
approvers:
    - Fortune-Ndlovu
